      "costUsd": 0.006275,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's a tree-planting crew. They plant fifty seedlings on their first day, eighty on the second and a hundred and ten on the third, thirty more each day as they get faster. After twelve days, have they planted more or less than twelve hundred seedlings? Many people say less, or about the same. Twelve days at around a hundred seedlings sounds like twelve hundred. Let's find out, and see how arithmetic sequences model change like this."
    },
    {
      "id": "scene-02",
      "changed": true,
      "audio": "public/audio/math-a12-f04/scene-02.wav",
      "durationInFrames": 940,
